{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o003a","title":"曹操擒关羽拜偏将军","accounts":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o003a-account","label":"《关张马黄赵传第六》正文","text":"曹操擒关羽拜偏将军","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o003a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"擒获授官","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"被擒受任","evidence":["guanzhang-e-o003a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":200,"label":"建安五年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"guanzhang-y200","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"guanzhang-q-o003","basis":"建安五年"},"evidence":["guanzhang-e-o003a-q","guanzhang-q-o003","zhouyu-q-o007","zhouyu-q-b-0f876b99dff40d7df348"]},"ordering_evidence":"guanzhang-e-o003a-q","source_order":[36,10,"O003a"],"order":6844}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-8598d8002cca4ca06d2c","layer":"original","quote":"建安五年，曹公东征，先主奔袁绍。曹公擒羽以归，拜为偏将军，礼之甚厚。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":9,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o003","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-8598d8002cca4ca06d2c","layer":"original","quote":"建安五年，曹公东征，先主奔袁绍。曹公擒羽以归，拜为偏将军，礼之甚厚。绍遣大将（军）颜良，攻东郡太守刘延于白马。曹公使张辽及羽为先锋击之。羽望见良麾盖〖2〗，策马刺良于万众之中，斩其首还；绍诸将莫能当者，遂解白马围。曹公即表封羽为汉寿亭侯。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":9,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-b-0f876b99dff40d7df348","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0f876b99dff40d7df348","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a1f25c9ebf9d7f652cf7","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o007","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-562fcd46fd346df33e09","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖1〗，策薨，权统事。瑜将兵赴丧，遂留吴，以中护军与长史张昭共掌众事。﹝一﹞","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
